  "_comment": [
    "Calibration anchors for scripts/style-score.mjs, captured 2026-08-03.",
    "",
    "Source: seven de-identified human-written SAPs on the company template,",
    "supplied by the maintainer. Five of them were scored by the clinician on",
    "QuillBot AI Detector v7.1.0 with a placeholder name substituted, so the",
    "CLIENT token could not itself read as machine text. Plan 3 is the one the",
    "maintainer independently suspected of AI assistance; plans 6 and 7 arrived",
    "later and were never scored.",
    "",
    "DELIBERATELY NO CLINICAL TEXT. Only the derived signals live here, so the",
    "calibration stays reproducible without real clinical work product entering",
    "git history. The plans themselves are not in this repo and should not be.",
    "",
    "recordedScore is what style-score.mjs returned at the commit that added",
    "this file. sap-detector-calibration.spec.js re-derives it from `metrics`",
    "using the current weights: if someone retunes them, that mismatch is the",
    "signal that docs/ai-detection-baseline.md no longer describes the scorer."
  ],
